# Obsidian vault settings for this repository.
#
# Only the JSON files that *list* which plugins are enabled are tracked — they
# are what makes the vault reproducible. Everything else Obsidian writes is
# per-machine state (window layout, theme, hotkeys, recent files) or is the
# plugin code itself, and none of it belongs in version control.
#
# Whitelist rather than blacklist: Obsidian creates new files constantly, and
# anything not explicitly re-included below stays ignored without this file
# needing to be updated each time.

# Ignore everything in this directory...
*

# ...then re-allow only the plugin lists and this file itself.
!.gitignore
!community-plugins.json
!core-plugins.json